<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (The butterfly servomotor was one of the first things I tested out, so I wrote a code that makes the servo move slightly back and forth. However, when I later tried to combine the servo code with the LED code, I ran into the issue that my servos' delay\(\) was affecting the LEDs. I learned that I had to use millis\(\) instead of delay\(\). This guide was very enlightening: https://forum.arduino.cc/t/using-millis-for-timing-a-beginners-guide/483573, and I had a friend help me with the new servo code!)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2 246 0 R 4]
