383 0 obj
<<
/Title (I know a lot of cosplayers use an Arduino for cosplay props, so I knew early on that I wanted to make something cosplay-related. After doing some research, I got my initial idea from this cosplayer,  who made a music-reactive Hatsune Miku wig. I really liked the idea of making something sound reactive, and I thought of the headphones Miku and Luka wear on an old Vocaloid song thumbnail, as I thought it would look really cool if they could light up. Initially, I also wanted to attach an LED strip on top, but I decided against it; it looks cleaner now. Other than that, my final project is very close to my initial idea of how the headphones would look and function like.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 248 0 R
>>
endobj
